id: hac-jo1v
title: Patch brace-expansion denial-of-service advisory
description: Release verification now fails because the explicit brace-expansion 5.0.7 override is affected by GHSA-mh99-v99m-4gvg / CVE-2026-14257; the registry and reviewed advisory identify 5.0.8 as patched.
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 0
tags[3]: dependency,security,supply-chain
