author: codex-root
estimated_minutes: 30
acceptance_criteria: package.json override and bun.lock resolve brace-expansion 5.0.8; bun audit returns zero vulnerabilities and the complete release verifier passes without exclusions or ignored advisories
definition_of_ready: GitHub reviewed advisory and npm registry both confirm patched version 5.0.8; dependency graph is inspected
goal: best-agent-home-assistant-cli
objective: restore-zero-known-high-vulnerabilities
value: Keep production readiness and mandatory supply-chain gates honest.
impact: Prevents attacker-influenced brace patterns from exhausting the lint/tooling process.
outcome: Patched deterministic dependency graph with green audit and release verification.
why_now: The advisory was published after the prior 5.0.7 remediation and blocks the current release gate.
