repro_steps: "Run bun run release:verify; step 2 reports brace-expansion <=5.0.7 affected by GHSA-mh99-v99m-4gvg"
resolution: Patched brace-expansion to 5.0.8 with a deterministic Bun lock; zero-vulnerability audit and complete release verifier pass.
expected_result: Mandatory dependency audit reports zero known vulnerabilities
actual_result: Audit exits 1 on brace-expansion 5.0.7
affected_version: 5.0.7
fixed_version: 5.0.8
component: dependency-overrides
regression: true
customer_impact: Release readiness is blocked; vulnerable development tooling can be crashed by crafted brace expansion input.
