comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T00:37:33.714Z",codex-root,All-status PM search found the earlier canonical override lineage hac-x41n but no item for this newly published advisory.
  "2026-07-25T00:45:10.278Z",codex-root,"The first PM-linked release run exposed pm-cli issue https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/689: injected tracker PM_PATH makes nested file validation resolve the sandbox as the workspace. Replaced the linked command with the documented source-workspace PM_PATH workaround; the standalone release verifier was already fully green."
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-07-25T00:37:33.714Z",codex-root,Use the smallest patched override; do not suppress Bun audit or weaken release verification.
