close_reason: "Updated package.json and bun.lock to brace-expansion 5.0.8. bun audit reports zero vulnerabilities. The PM-linked complete release verifier now passes after preserving source-workspace PM resolution: 1,236 tests, exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, strict PM integrity, Trivy, full-history secret scan, and commit quality."
body: The vulnerable package is a development-only transitive dependency of minimatch through ESLint and typescript-eslint. Preserve the strict audit gate and update the existing override plus Bun lockfile to the smallest patched release.
